   "text": "## Troubleshooting\n\n| Problem              | Likely cause                  | Fix                               |\n|----------------------|-------------------------------|-----------------------------------|\n| Gummy crumb          | Sliced too early              | Wait the full 24 hours            |\n| Large crack on top   | Underproofed                  | Proof until small cracks appear   |\n| Very sour taste      | Levain left too long          | Shorten the levain to 12 hours    |\n| Flat loaf            | Weak starter                  | Feed the starter twice before use |\n\n"
  }
 ]
